&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;For more by us, check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/greyve-author-page&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;the Greyve Page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/jakdragonx-rage-collection&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Personnel File: JakdragonX&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
