&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a just-for-fun type of page for people to list their accomplishments and provide badges for display on their author pages. Please leave a comment listing every achievement you are eligible for along with any relevant links to verify your claim. This is optional for now, we&#039;re going by the honor system. After all, anyone caught clout-chasing by claiming achievements they hadn&#039;t earned would inevitably be discovered and reveal the weak character of the perpetrator.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Keep entries at approximate Tweet-length, if they&#039;re too long they will be trimmed. Try not to have excessively long lists of links. Keep it clean and classy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feel free to leave suggestions in the discussion page for future achievements to be added in the comments. This page is intended to grow over time so check back occasionally for new achievements.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white&quot;&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Secret Achievements Not Yet Unlocked&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
